// EXPECT: qualified_ok
// 完全限定调用（`Type(Trait).method(receiver, ...)`）就是歧义门要求的
// 消歧：同一对工具方法按限定的 trait 派发。

trait A {
    get(self): Int;
};
trait B {
    fetch(self): Int;
};

given A {
    describe(self): Int = 1;
};
given B {
    describe(self): Int = 2;
};

type Box(x: Int);

given Box: A {
    get(self): Int = 0;
};
given Box: B {
    fetch(self): Int = 0;
};

let main(): Int = {
    let b = Box(1);
    assert(Box(A).describe(b) == 1, "qualified to A");
    assert(Box(B).describe(b) == 2, "qualified to B");
    // 顺序无关：先调 B 后调 A 不得串体。
    let c = Box(2);
    assert(Box(B).describe(c) == 2, "B first");
    assert(Box(A).describe(c) == 1, "A second");
    // 单一工具源的未限定调用照常。
    assert(b.get() == 0, "single source unqualified");
    println("qualified_ok");
    return 0;
};
